Package: bincraft
Title: Toolbox For Building R Package Binaries on Linux
Version: 4.4.1.9999
Authors@R:
    person("Patrick", "Schratz", , "mail@devxy.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build, archive, remove and update R binary packages on Linux.
    Binaries are stored in S3. Creation and curation of package index
    files is supported.  Build metadata can be optionally stored in a
    database.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://codefloe.com/rpkgs/bincraft, https://bincraft.doc.rpkgs.com
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
